## Integration acceptance

- Disconnect during a read, configuration save and device request separately; record how each reconciles after native reconnect.
- Check that no action is automatically replayed and an entity-level unavailable state does not claim application-wide failure.
- Verify safe/recovery mode cleanup, focus continuity and one announcement per meaningful connection transition.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

